# A tab's badge cells (the 󰅖) route a right press to the tab's menu,
# as Rust's tab rect did — a left press there still closes. The menu
# carries the file rows: the two reveals and the path.
write a.txt "hello\n"
open a.txt
rightclick 39 1
expect screen contains "┌ a.txt"
expect screen contains "Close others"
expect screen contains "Reveal in tree"
key esc
expect pane "a.txt"
